---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';

const openers = [
  { name: "Alyssa", role: "Vocals", order: 1, img: "/images/alyssa.webp" },
  { name: "Ben", role: "Bass", order: 2, img: "/images/ben.webp" },
  { name: "Brian", role: "Sound Guy", order: 3, img: "/images/brian.webp" },
  { name: "Carney", role: "Lead Guitar", order: 4, img: "/images/carney.webp" },
  { name: "Devan", role: "Rhythm Guitar", order: 5, img: "/images/devan.webp" },
  { name: "Evan", role: "Tour Manager", order: 6, img: "/images/evan.webp" },
  { name: "Jake", role: "Drums", order: 7, img: "/images/jake.webp" },
  { name: "Jordan", role: "Lights", order: 9, img: "/images/jordan.webp" },
  { name: "Matt", role: "Security", order: 10, img: "/images/matt.webp" },
  { name: "Maya", role: "Keys", order: 10, img: "/images/maya.webp" },
].sort((a, b) => a.order - b.order);
---
<Layout title="Meet the Band">
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 w-full mt-8 text-center text-zinc-100">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl text-white font-display mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">Meet The Band</h1>
    <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm mb-12">Trent & Shy • Est. 2022</p>

    <div class="w-full h-64 sm:h-96 mb-12 border border-zinc-700 relative overflow-hidden group shadow-2xl">
      <img 
        src="/images/about.webp" 
        alt="Trent and Shy" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" 
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 border-[12px] border-zinc-800/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 p-8 shadow-2xl mb-12 text-left rounded-sm">
      <h2 class="text-3xl text-pink-400 font-display mb-4 uppercase">How It Started</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        April 5, 2022- The day we met neither of us were looking for love, a broken nose, concussions or lifelong friendships, but Baltimore Soundstage had other plans. If you ask us what our story is we’ll both add our own spin but one thing is for certain- it was fate. One of Shy’s concert friends gave her tickets to this sold out concert hours before doors. Trent was preparing to get stationed in Korea the very next day. That morning he sold his Harley, packed his bags (definitely no more than 4 times (it was 5)) and tried to offload all his upcoming concert tickets to the friends he had met in line. Little did he know he was about to meet his match- Shy had tickets to all the shows he would be missing. Very shortly after meeting, Trent and Shy were in their own little world. In the one video Shy has of the main act’s set, you very clearly hear her say “oh shit,” when she catches a glimpse of Trent’s very broken nose. Laughs were shared, mosh pits and crowd surfers endured but alas, Trent shipped out the next day and our little group fell violently ill with Covid 48 hours later. Recovering from Covid & the time zone differences were definitely a challenge but it didn’t stop us from being each other's concert buddies. We would update each other on the concerts (brag about it) and argue about who had the better taste in music. It’s no surprise to any of us that it’s Shy.
      </p>

      <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        June 30, 2022- Two weeks prior Trent had invited Shy to go to a music festival in Germany. Keep in mind, they had only met that one time at the show. Trent meant the invitation wholeheartedly but there was literally no way someone would be crazy enough to do something like that… He woke up to a text that next morning that Shy had in fact bought a ticket. Fast forward to the Stuttgart train station after Shy’s ROUGH day of travel, Red Bull in hand Trent was the biggest sigh of relief. We then hopped straight into a car to head to a concert in the middle of nowhere (literally- there was no signage… we broke into someone's backyard). Fast forward to the night before the music festival. We partied all night with the headliner of the festival- he looked at us and said we should be together.
      </p>

      <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
        The rest is history. We have met twice and now you’re all invited to our wedding. Helluva story deserves one helluva party- you in?
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mb-12 mt-20">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white font-display mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-zinc-700 pb-4 inline-block">The Openers</h2>
      <p class="text-pink-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm mt-4">The wedding party warming up the stage for the main act</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">
      {openers.map(person => (
        <div class="w-[calc(50%-12px)] md:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] lg:w-[calc(25%-18px)] flex-none group relative bg-zinc-800/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-zinc-700 overflow-hidden hover:border-pink-400 transition-colors rounded-sm shadow-lg">
          <div class="aspect-square bg-zinc-900 relative">
            <img 
              src={person.img} 
              alt={person.name} 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
            />
            <div class="hidden absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity bg-zinc-950">
                <svg class="w-20 h-20 text-zinc-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-zinc-950 via-zinc-950/20 to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 absolute bottom-0 w-full text-center">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-display text-white uppercase tracking-widest leading-none">{person.name}</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>